                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Love \u0026 Pop\"] July 19, 1997.The bubble has burst.Japan\u0027s economic boom of the 1980\u0027s has long since passed, but the ramifications of the rapid expansion and technological development the country underwent still remains. Tokyo is one of the most densely populated cities in the entire world, with a staggering amount of financial capital concentrated in a shockingly small amount of space. It is the most monolithic of monoliths, all the towers and skyscrapers and monuments to the excesses of capital prosperity casting their shadows until all the light of the sun is totally blotted out.Among these many shadows,",
